      "surface": "MTLArgumentEncoder and argument buffer helper APIs",
      "reason": "Current D3D12 descriptor/root-signature path does not use Metal argument encoders directly."
    },
    {
      "surface": "Metal 4 placement-sparse heap-page aliasing APIs",
      "reason": "The proven D3D12 sparse path uses native Metal sparse heaps and resource-state mapping for 2D RGBA8 textures; the native MTL4 sparse-buffer bridge and heap-buffer placement path are now present for the focused buffer path, while MTL4 placement-sparse texture selection and mapping-copy operations remain gated."
    },
    {
      "surface": "MTLIndirectCommandBuffer APIs",
      "reason": "Current indirect D3D12 execution records DrawInstanced/DrawIndexedInstanced/Dispatch through command-list replay, not Metal ICBs."
    },
    {
      "surface": "Metal 4 explicit barriers",
      "reason": "The current barrier path uses shared events, fences, and existing memory-barrier commands; Metal 4 barriers stay behind future availability-gated proof."
    }
